{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114827","id":3162002898,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc68eFXS","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114827","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114827.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114827.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114827","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114827/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114827/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114827/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/65ce1360b4e3e27b0caab1d09910860d3f50d645","number":114827,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Network: Normalize IP parsing, fix IPv6, tests","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR normalize IP parsing across `String` and `IPAddress`, fixes many cases of incorrect parsing, and adds many test cases to validate the new parser.\r\n\r\nThe parser is designed to do zero heap allocations, although I'm not particularly fond of the code (parsing IPv6 is hard :sob: ), the result is much better than before and makes `String.is_valid_ip_address` consistent with `IPAddress.is_valid`.\r\n\r\nCloses #114245 (superseded)\r\nCloses #112554 (superseded)\r\nCloses #99624 (superseded)\r\nFixes #112511\r\nFixes #99623\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <summary>Tests result with the old implementation</summary>\r\n  \r\n```\r\n===============================================================================\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:51:\r\nTEST CASE:  [IPAddress] IPv4 is_valid\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:59: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"127.0.0.-1\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:60: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"127.0.0.256\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:61: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"127.0.0.\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:62: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\".0.0.1\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n===============================================================================\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:90:\r\nTEST CASE:  [IPAddress] IPv6 is_valid\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:134: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::-0\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:135: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"1:1:1:1:1:1:1:g\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:136: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"1:1:1:1:1:1:1:1:1\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:137: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"1:1:1:1:1:1:1:1::\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:138: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::1:1:1:1:1:1:1:1\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:140: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::1::1\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:144: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"1::ffff:127.0.0.1\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:145: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::1:ffff:127.0.0.1\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:146: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::ffff:127.0.256.1\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:147: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::ffff:127.0.0.256\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:148: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::ffff:256.0.0.1\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:149: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::ffff:127.0.0.1.1\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:150: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::ffff:127.0.0.1.\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:151: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::ffff:127.0.0.\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:152: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::ffff:127.0.0\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:153: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::ffff:127.0.\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:154: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::ffff:127.0\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:155: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::ffff:127.\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:156: ERROR: CHECK( IPAddress(\"::ffff:\").is_valid() == false ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( true == false )\r\n\r\n===============================================================================\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:164:\r\nTEST CASE:  [IPAddress] IPv6 Parsing\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:198: ERROR: CHECK( test_ip(\"::ffff:127.0.0.1\", { 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0xFFFF, 0x7F00, 1 }) ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:199: ERROR: CHECK( test_ip(\"::FFFF:127.0.0.1\", { 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0xFFFF, 0x7F00, 1 }) ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:200: ERROR: CHECK( test_ip(\"0::ffff:127.0.0.1\", { 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0xFFFF, 0x7F00, 1 }) ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:201: ERROR: CHECK( test_ip(\"0:0::ffff:127.0.0.1\", { 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0xFFFF, 0x7F00, 1 }) ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:202: ERROR: CHECK( test_ip(\"0:0:0::ffff:127.0.0.1\", { 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0xFFFF, 0x7F00, 1 }) ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( false )\r\n\r\n./tests/core/io/test_ip_address.h:203: ERROR: CHECK( test_ip(\"0:0:0:0::ffff:127.0.0.1\", { 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0xFFFF, 0x7F00, 1 }) ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( false )\r\n\r\n===============================================================================\r\n[doctest] test cases:   5 |  2 passed |  3 failed | 1274 skipped\r\n[doctest] assertions: 110 | 81 passed | 29 failed |\r\n[doctest] Status: FAILURE!\r\n```\r\n  \r\n</details>","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":649800701,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2NDk4MDA3MDE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:network","name":"topic:network","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/rec